"450" alt="A single bare desk lit by one lamp in an empty office at night, a window with blurred city lights behind it" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></span><span class="nx-card-b"><span class="nx-tag">Admin time</span><span class="nx-card-t">Owners lose 11&nbsp;hours a week to admin. Here is the bill.</span><span class="nx-card-d">Six working days a month on admin, 3.6 on sales. The arithmetic, with a calculator for your own week.</span><span class="nx-card-m">6 min read &middot; 8 October 2026</span></span></a></div></div></section><section class="nx-end"><div class="wrap nx-end-in"><div><h2>A process that runs without being remembered.</h2><p>The gap above is mostly the distance between trying AI and giving it a job with rules. Twinthos does the second: it runs a defined process for your business, and a person stays above the line where judgment is needed.</p></div><div class="nx-end-act"><a class="nx-btn" href="/how-it-works/">See how it works</a><a class="nx-btn ghost" href="/how-it-works/">How it works</a></div></div></section>
